# Bare patterns like ".venv/" only match at the build context ROOT in
# Docker's ignore semantics (unlike .gitignore, which matches at any
# depth) -- a stray sanad/.venv/ (1.3GB, leftover from an early setup
# mistake) slipped straight past the un-prefixed version of this file
# and made every `docker compose build` transfer 100MB+ of build context
# before stalling. Every directory pattern below is now "**/" prefixed
# so it matches regardless of nesting.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.db
**/.DS_Store
**/*chroma_db*/
**/sanad_uploads/
**/node_modules/
.env
.git/
.github/
*.docx
ml/data/
ml/artifacts/
